# NestJS API

## Module layout

One domain per folder: `signals/`, `results/`, `events/`, `realtime/`, `notifications/`, `queue/`.

## Signal updates

After Prisma persist, call `SignalEventService`:
- create → `handleCreate`
- update → `handleUpdate(before, after)`
- delete → `handleDelete` (WS only, no push)

One dominant `SignalEventType` per update (priority in `signal-event.service.ts`).

## Realtime

- Gateway path: `/api/v1/realtime`
- Channels: `signals:spot`, `signals:futures`, `signals:all`
- Always broadcast `signal:updated`; optional `signal:event`
- Redis pub/sub channel: `qpulse:ws`

## BullMQ

- Queue: `push-notifications`
- Enqueue from SignalEventService — never block admin HTTP response
- Retry: 3× exponential backoff

## Validation

- `closeDate` required when `status=CLOSED`
- `liquidated=true` only when CLOSED; set `slHit=false`
- Map entities via `common/mappers/signal.mapper.ts`

## Auth

`JwtAuthGuard` on all `/admin/*` except login/refresh. Refresh in httpOnly cookie.

## Types

Import DTOs from `@qpulse/shared`. Prisma enums from `@prisma/client`.
